### Insights:
The above groups and interactions reflect the multidimensional nature of defect prediction. Complexity highlights logic-heavy regions of code, Halstead metrics measure cognitive difficulty, and structure metrics focus on maintainability. Inter-group interactions capture nuanced relationships, driving prediction power. These should guide feature engineering for downstream tasks.
